'What is {topic}?','Explain {topic} in simple terms.','Can you explain {topic} in detail?','How does {topic} work?','Why is {topic} important?','What should a customer know about {topic}?','What are the main points about {topic}?','Give me a practical explanation of {topic}.','What mistakes should I avoid with {topic}?','How should I understand {topic} before buying insurance?','What are common questions about {topic}?','Explain {topic} with an example.','How can {topic} affect a customer?','What should an insurance agent explain about {topic}?','What should an admin know about {topic}?','How do I check {topic} properly?','What are the risks related to {topic}?','What are best practices for {topic}?','How is {topic} handled in an insurance company?','What happens if there is a problem with {topic}?',
